WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.918 line:0%
Come on, y'all.

00:00:01.001 --> 00:00:03.587 position:66% line:0%
<i>Moz, Cocoa, and the kids moving back home;</i>

00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:05.214 line:0%
it's Black Family Magic.

00:00:05.297 --> 00:00:06.215 line:0%
Smile, there you go.

00:00:06.298 --> 00:00:09.343 line:0%
<i>We're one big happy family,
under one happy roof.</i>

00:00:09.426 --> 00:00:10.677 line:0%
I hope you been studying.

00:00:10.761 --> 00:00:11.970 line:0%
No!

00:00:12.054 --> 00:00:13.680 position:58% line:0%
You need to teach me how you do that.

00:00:13.764 --> 00:00:14.806 line:0%
It's a gift, baby.

00:00:15.599 --> 00:00:17.434 position:58% line:0%
Black Family Magic is being together.

00:00:17.518 --> 00:00:18.477 line:0%
Sticking together.

00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:20.062 line:0%
And praying together.

00:00:20.145 --> 00:00:21.563 line:0%
Jesus, help me!

00:00:23.607 --> 00:00:25.567 line:0%
It's doing everything
with a little bit of attitude.

00:00:25.651 --> 00:00:26.860 line:0%
Hey, Jade!

00:00:27.110 --> 00:00:28.028 line:0%
Do I know you?

00:00:29.321 --> 00:00:31.156 line:0%
Black Family Magic is confusing.

00:00:32.741 --> 00:00:34.284 line:0%
Oh, I don't even want to know.

00:00:35.285 --> 00:00:37.579 line:0%
It's M'Dears sweet potato pie.

00:00:39.331 --> 00:00:40.332 line:0%
Can I get some of... Dad?

00:00:40.415 --> 00:00:43.168 line:0%
Black Family Magic
is snapping peas on the porch.

00:00:43.252 --> 00:00:47.047 line:0%
Snap the ends off
while we engage in conversation.

00:00:47.130 --> 00:00:49.883 position:66% line:0%
That's what the old folks call "Snapchat."

00:00:52.177 --> 00:00:54.721 line:0%
It's time for the McKellan slide!

